{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043555_01a94819","chunk_index":15,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043555_01a94819","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:04880a503197691b430e3992","quote":"章节编号=8.8\n章节标题=妊娠事件的报告与随访","quote_sha256":"2fbf75faf2b8f42526ff0187cb1ce246b60fb07edc0bb9b946a83d89ad5e36a9","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","span_id":"span_pkt_8_8"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_pop_desc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_exclusion_pregnancy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_8_8","span_pop_desc","span_exclusion_pregnancy","span_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"妊娠事件的报告与随访","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章规定研究期间妊娠事件报告与随访的适用范围与总体要求。本研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期个体按排除标准不予入组。适用范围覆盖筛选期、为期16周的双盲治疗期以及为期4周的安全性随访期内发生的妊娠事件。研究期间经确认发生的妊娠事件及其结局信息纳入受试者安全性资料管理，并按照适用监管要求完成报告与随访，相关记录用于安全性数据的汇总与评价。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期个体按排除标准不予入组；筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周。本章仅界定妊娠事件报告与随访的适用范围与记录归属。医学作者需核对并落实：妊娠事件报告表与报告对象、报告时限、妊娠结局随访期限，以及先天畸形、自然流产等情形的报告归类，均需与药物警戒和伦理要求一致。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（妊娠事件的报告与随访）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043555_01a94819","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:04880a503197691b430e3992","quote":"章节编号=9\n章节标题=统计分析","quote_sha256":"ad86233544f5ecca4636ca77ad3f15463d6a372bb0aa3f140edef4fae0d42492","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","span_id":"span_pkt_9"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_stats_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"3deb9bac879bd9b7640c483aa2f9818610b5e6e19c4e8c1bbbc26a05016a1863","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_no_reestimation"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_key_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_other_secondary"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_9","span_estimand","span_stats_strategy","span_sample_size","span_no_reestimation","span_primary_endpoint","span_key_secondary","span_other_secondary"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章规定本研究的分析人群与主要统计分析方法。全分析集包括所有随机受试者，按随机分组进行分析；安全性集按受试者实际接受的治疗进行分析。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例，采用CMH方法在全分析集中比较试验组与安慰剂组，报告组间应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。缺失数据处理方面，停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析。样本量假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。本研究不开展期中分析，也不进行样本量再估计。关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例、第16周PASI 90应答的受试者比例，其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：全分析集为所有随机受试者且按随机分组分析，采用CMH方法比较第16周PASI 75应答并报告率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标；停药或救援治疗按复合策略判定无应答，其他缺失数据无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；样本量假设为60%对30%、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机、15%脱落、共132例（每组66例）；不开展期中分析，也不进行样本量再估计。医学作者需核对：关键次要终点与其他次要终点的分析方法、检验顺序及多重性控制策略，以及敏感性分析的具体实施细节。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043555_01a94819","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:04880a503197691b430e3992","quote":"章节编号=9.5\n章节标题=安全性数据分析","quote_sha256":"842a9e87c54701f663e0c17fb89e5e71b34eba55dd0b12fa5695d611bee66a4d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","span_id":"span_pkt_9_5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_stats_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety_endpoints"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_9_5","span_stats_strategy","span_safety_endpoints"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"安全性分析在安全性集上进行，按受试者实际接受的治疗分组进行分析。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。分析时按治疗组汇总上述终点，分别计算不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的发生率，并归纳实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图的临床意义变化情况，用于评价合成试验药A在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中的安全性。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：安全性集按实际治疗分析；安全性终点为治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。医学作者需核对：不良事件的汇总与呈现方式、是否开展亚组或暴露校正分析，以及安全性数据汇总的截止时点。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043555_01a94819","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:04880a503197691b430e3992","quote":"章节编号=10\n章节标题=数据采集与管理","quote_sha256":"8d852c5c1a331f1fcfd19cfe9974334fe2f4aa2dc92fd6a1c5a3fb5c891f010d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","span_id":"span_pkt_10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_other_secondary"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_10","span_periods","span_visits","span_adherence","span_other_secondary"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"数据采集与管理","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章规定研究数据采集、记录与管理的要求。研究按访视安排采集数据：筛选期最长4周，筛选合格后受试者于基线/第1天随机；双盲治疗期16周内安排第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视，并在第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价；皮肤病相关生活质量采用DLQI评价，第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化为次要终点之一。试验药物的依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。研究数据包括疗效评价数据、安全性数据和依从性数据。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：筛选期最长4周，基线/第1天随机，治疗期访视在第2、4、8、12、16周，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；DLQI相关的次要终点为第16周评分较基线的变化；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。医学作者需核对：DLQI的采集时点、量表版本与授权，实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图在各访视的采集安排，以及数据管理职责分工、电子病例报告表设计与签署、数据核查与质疑处理、数据库锁定等数据管理要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6","section_number":"10","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:04880a503197691b430e3992","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:04880a503197691b430e3992","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"e1861c1cf